                                "sense_id": "8eb60d93-dc5b-32c7-ad77-a8c683704494",
                                "text": "This gift for taking the urgent issues of the day and presenting them as detective stories that race past like footfalls down an alleyway has made Pamuk the best-selling writer in the history of his native Turkey and the deserving winner of last year’s Nobel Prize in Literature, at the unvenerable age of 54."
